//
// Full mobilenet on the NPU2: @iron.jit compile, three launches on one hardware
// context, last output checked bit-exact against mobilenet_numpy and within
// the measured 3 of golden_output.txt.
//
// No --sa-effort override: the design's own default (0.05, chosen for
// compile speed -- see sa_placer_flags) is already fast enough for a lit
// smoke test. The nightly component check covers the full-effort budget
// (and a seed sweep) instead.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: cd %S/.. && %run_on_npu2% %python -m mobilenet.aie2_mobilenet_iron -w 1 -i 2 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS!
